{"id":"aaf4dd557290b9da","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STRawRow.md","title":"STRawRow","display":"STRawRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STRawRow","parameters":["B","C","z737","z738","z739"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STRawRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>C</span><span>z737</span><span>z738</span><span>z739</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型语法。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>z737</code>、<code>z738</code>、<code>z739</code>。</p>\n<p>带简单类型注解的原始项。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STRawRow B C z737 z738 z739)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z739 t)\n    (or\n      (exists z742 (and (@ Nat z742) (@ TVar z742 t)))\n      (or\n        (exists z743 (and (in z743 C) (@ TConst z743 t)))\n        (or\n          (exists z744\n            (exists z745\n              (and\n                (@ STTy B z744)\n                (and\n                  (@ TLam z744 z745 t)\n                  (exists z748 (exists z749 (and (in z748 z738) (and (@ App z737 z748 z749) (= z749 z745)))))))))\n          (exists z746\n            (exists z747\n              (and\n                (@ TApp z746 z747 t)\n                (and\n                  (exists z750 (exists z751 (and (in z750 z738) (and (@ App z737 z750 z751) (= z751 z746)))))\n                  (exists z752 (exists z753 (and (in z752 z738) (and (@ App z737 z752 z753) (= z753 z747))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f8de35d9c555d924\" href=\"?note=f8de35d9c555d924\" title=\"ZFC_STTy\">STTy</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ce774aac70609584\" href=\"?note=ce774aac70609584\" title=\"ZFC_TConst\">TConst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STRawRow B C z737 z738 z739)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_STTy|STTy]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_